      "The Move 10 collision accusation: Colleagues 9 and 13 attacked Colleague 12 by claiming Move 10 placed Disk 3 onto Peg 3 atop Disk 1. Virtually every 21-proponent (Colleagues 10, 11, 12, 16, 17, 18, 3, 4, 6) instantly refuted this by pointing out that Move 10 moves Disk 3 to Peg 2, which was vacated by Disk 8 at Move 7. Continuing to claim Move 10 is illegal will destroy our credibility.",
